          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abu nai Belisasar tolimu ŋakiro, ido aponi kitanapikinae Daniel elou ŋolo kipurat areŋan, toenikinae erikot ŋolo itiyaunitae a egolid lodokole keŋ ka aponi tolimoroe ŋakiro nu aŋuna a Daniel atemar aruwor iŋes ekapolon ŋolo a ŋiuni ŋolo iwuapit erwosit anapukan keŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.5.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
